[en.DECISION_FACTORY_CONVERSION_OFFENSIVE]
Emergency Factory Conversion

[en.DECISION_FACTORY_CONVERSION_OFFENSIVE_desc]
More equipment is desperately needed on the front. We urgently need to convert more factories to produce arms and vehicles to defend our country.

[zh.DECISION_FACTORY_CONVERSION_OFFENSIVE]
紧急工厂转换

[zh.DECISION_FACTORY_CONVERSION_OFFENSIVE_desc]
前线急需更多装备，我们必须转换更多的工厂来制造武器，以此保卫我们的国家。
